    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25THE NEW CHALLENGING CLIMBING GAME IS WAITING FOR YOU\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascendrix will give you nothing but the real challenge. You need to beat the dynamic hard route of multiple-sectioned tower.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0fExplore the cyberspace locations with hard trap and obstacle mechanics\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0f&quot;Watch your step!&quot; is a rule \u21161, and &quot;Hurry up!&quot; is a rule \u21162\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0fCatch the right moments to move or jump\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0fFall and get more rage every time it's happened\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course,  Hardcore Mode is waiting for you, if you're tough enough or lack of pure rage\u00a0\ud83d\udd25</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25THE NEW CHALLENGING CLIMBING GAME IS WAITING FOR YOU\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascendrix will give you nothing but the real challenge. You need to beat the dynamic hard route of multiple-sectioned tower.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0fExplore the cyberspace locations with hard trap and obstacle mechanics\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0f&quot;Watch your step!&quot; is a rule \u21161, and &quot;Hurry up!&quot; is a rule \u21162\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0fCatch the right moments to move or jump\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0fFall and get more rage every time it's happened\u26a1\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course,  Hardcore Mode is waiting for you, if you're tough enough or lack of pure rage\u00a0\ud83d\udd25</p>",
